{"id":"schuldig","lemma":"schuldig","pos":"adj","rank":878,"glosses":["[with genitive] guilty (of), culpable","[with accusative] owing, indebted to"],"ipa":"/ˈʃʊldɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fe/De-schuldig.ogg/De-schuldig.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"schuldiger","superlative":"am schuldigsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Fühlst du dich schuldig?","en":"Do you feel guilty?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390631","words":[{"g":"to feel","l":"fühlen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},null]},{"text":"Wie viel bin ich dir schuldig?","en":"How much do I owe you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755389","words":[null,null,{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"how much"]]},{"text":"Ich fühle mich dafür schuldig.","en":"I feel guilty about it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755470","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to feel","l":"fühlen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"for that, for it"},null]},{"text":"Sie sind alle schuldig.","en":"They're all guilty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/745383","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"all, everyone"},null]},{"text":"Was sind wir schuldig?","en":"What do we owe?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/178204","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"we"},null]}]}